# Kumo UI (Cloudflare dashboard)

Canonical docs: https://kumo-ui.com/

## Must

- Build UI with `@cloudflare/kumo` components and blocks from kumo-ui.com
- Colors: Kumo **semantic** Tailwind tokens only (see https://kumo-ui.com/colors)
- Light/dark: set `data-mode="light"` or `data-mode="dark"` on `<html>` — never Tailwind `dark:` variants
- **Charts/graphs:** only Kumo chart stack from https://kumo-ui.com/charts/
  - Hub: [Charts](https://kumo-ui.com/charts/)
  - Time trends: [TimeseriesChart](https://kumo-ui.com/charts/timeseries/)
  - Other plots: [Custom Chart](https://kumo-ui.com/charts/custom/) (`Chart`)
  - Colors: [ChartPalette](https://kumo-ui.com/charts/colors/) — see palette rules below
  - Series labels: `ChartLegend` (`LargeItem` / `SmallItem`)
  - Peer dep: `echarts` (tree-shake imports per Kumo docs); pass `echarts` into `TimeseriesChart` / `Chart`
- App chrome: use Kumo `Sidebar` for side navigation
- Typography: **Geist** (`@fontsource-variable/geist`) as default UI font
- Before inventing a custom control or chart, check kumo-ui.com first

## Chart palette rules

Pick the palette by data task ([chart colors](https://kumo-ui.com/charts/colors/)):

| System | When | API | Poultry examples |
|--------|------|-----|------------------|
| **Semantic** | Inherent polarity / status / primary vs secondary metric | `ChartPalette.semantic(token, isDark)` | Eggs=`Neutral`, Birds=`Attention`; alerts/callouts `Warning` / `Success` |
| **Categorical** | Nominal series with no polarity (farms, sheds) | `ChartPalette.categorical(i % 5, isDark)` | Shed/farm performance bar charts |
| **Sequential** | Density / magnitude scale only | `ChartPalette.sequential(...)` | Heatmaps — **out of MVP scope** |

Semantic tokens for charts: `Attention`, `Warning`, `Success`, `Neutral`, `Disabled`, `Skeleton`.

Always pass `isDarkMode` from theme (`data-mode` / `pf-theme`). Never invent hex/farm greens outside `ChartPalette`.

## Must not

- Custom brand palettes (green/straw/farm themes, etc.) that bypass Kumo tokens
- Custom SVG/canvas chart replacements when Kumo charts cover the need
- Raw ECharts UI without wrapping in Kumo `TimeseriesChart` / `Chart`
- A second UI kit beside Kumo without an ADR
- Using categorical for polarity data, or semantic for many identity series that need distinguishability

## Theme toggle

Persist mode in `localStorage` (`pf-theme`) and keep `<html data-mode>` in sync.
Pass `isDarkMode` into Kumo chart components from the same theme.

## With taste-skill

Layout/spacing/hierarchy anti-slop comes from `design-taste-frontend` (see `.cursor/rules/taste-skill.mdc`). Kumo still owns components, tokens, charts, and `data-mode`.
